    <bpmn:process id="W_W3866" name="W3866. Ecommerce &amp; Digital Channel Fraud Prevention" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Ecommerce checkout (links to VS-10); order placement
Frequency: Continuous (~42,900 ecommerce orders/month)
Volume: ~515K ecommerce orders/yr; ~2–5% held for review; COD high-risk subset
Owner: Fraud Management / Ecommerce
Participants: Fraud Management, Ecommerce Ops (links to VS-10), Payments (links to VS-80), Logistics (links to VS-06/VS-56), Loyalty (links to VS-13), IT (links to VS-27/VS-113), Privacy (links to VS-91), Marketplace (links to VS-95)
Source: workflow W3866 — Ecommerce &amp; Digital Channel Fraud Prevention</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3866_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3866_Lane1" name="Fraud Management">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3866_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3866_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3866_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3866_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3866_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3866_Start3" name="Ecommerce checkout (links to VS-10); order placement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3866_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3866_Task4" name="Fraud Management/Ecommerce score every card-not-present order at checkout…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Fraud Management/Ecommerce score every card-not-present order at checkout (links to VS-10) using device intelligence, 3-D Secure/Strong-Customer-Auth (BSP/QRPh), velocity, address/courier risk, and behavioral signals (links to W3859/W3861), with synchronous approve/step-up/decline within checkout flow
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / Ecommerce / Payments
Accountable (A): Fraud Management Lead
Duration: Real-time</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3866_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3866_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3866_Task5" name="Fraud Management manage COD fraud (the dominant PH ecommerce risk): non-receipt…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Fraud Management manage COD fraud (the dominant PH ecommerce risk): non-receipt claims, fake-address/undeliverable, courier collusion, return-fraud on delivery; pre-screen COD orders (links to VS-06.3/VS-56) and apply holds/deposits for high-risk customers (links to VS-126 identity)
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / Ecommerce / Logistics
Accountable (A): Fraud Management Lead
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3866_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3866_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3866_Task6" name="Fraud Management handle order holds, manual review queue, customer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Fraud Management handle order holds, manual review queue, customer communication (links to VS-13 CX), and false-positive recovery (approve good orders) with feedback to model tuning (links to W3862)
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / Ecommerce
Accountable (A): Fraud Management Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3866_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3866_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3866_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3866_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3866_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-605 (ensure controlled execution — Channel-Specific Fraud Prevention &amp; Detection (PA-125.2).) | - operational: COD scoring and delivery-confirmation controls; operational: tuned models and step-up auth
Owner: Fraud Management / Ecommerce</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3866_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3866_Annotation8" targetRef="W3866_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3866_Flow10" sourceRef="W3866_Start3" targetRef="W3866_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3866_Flow11" sourceRef="W3866_Task4" targetRef="W3866_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3866_Flow12" sourceRef="W3866_Task5" targetRef="W3866_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3866_Flow13" sourceRef="W3866_Task6" targetRef="W3866_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
