      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Login/auth event (links to VS-10/VS-75); suspicious session
Frequency: Continuous (~600K loyalty + ecommerce accounts)
Volume: Bot/credential-stuffing attacks periodic; ATO incidents ~dozens–hundreds/yr
Owner: Fraud Management / IT Security
Participants: Fraud Management, IT Security (links to VS-27.3), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), Mobile App (links to VS-75), Loyalty (links to VS-13), Privacy (links to VS-91), CX (links to VS-13)
Source: workflow W3871 — Account Takeover &amp; Credential Abuse Prevention</bpmn:documentation>
