      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3871_Task4" name="Fraud Management/IT-Security prevent ATO across login surfaces (ecommerce links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Fraud Management/IT-Security prevent ATO across login surfaces (ecommerce links to VS-10, mobile app links to VS-75, loyalty portal links to VS-13): credential-stuffing/bot defense (links to VS-27.3), device/anomaly scoring, MFA/step-up on high-risk login, and breach-credential monitoring
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / IT Security / Ecommerce
Accountable (A): Fraud Management Lead
Duration: Real-time</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3871_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3871_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3871_Task5" name="Fraud Management/Loyalty detect and respond to ATO outcomes: unauthorized point…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Fraud Management/Loyalty detect and respond to ATO outcomes: unauthorized point burn, address/payment change, order placement to fraud address, gift-card cash-out (links to W3869) — freeze account, notify customer (links to VS-13), and reverse unauthorized transactions
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / Loyalty / CX
Accountable (A): Fraud Management Lead
Duration: Per incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3871_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3871_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3871_Task6" name="Fraud Management/Privacy handle breach-notification obligations if ATO…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Fraud Management/Privacy handle breach-notification obligations if ATO indicates a notifiable data breach under RA 10173 (72-hour NPC notification — links to VS-91/W53)
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / Privacy / Legal
Accountable (A): Fraud Management Lead
Duration: Per incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3871_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3871_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
